# OS and editor droppings
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# images/ is a whitelist. Only the web-ready files index.html actually references
# can be committed. Raw camera exports (IMG_1234.jpg, "Barbs kitchen.jpg") are
# several MB each and carry GPS coordinates of the customer's house in their
# metadata, so they must never be pushed. Run tools/prep-photo.py to make a
# web-ready copy under one of the allowed names — see README section 2.
images/*
!images/.gitkeep
# brand assets (from the logo package)
!images/logo.svg
!images/logo-full.svg
!images/logo-stacked.svg
!images/favicon.svg
!images/favicon.png
!images/apple-touch-icon.png
!images/icon-192.png
!images/og-image.png
# photos, always made with tools/prep-photo.py
!images/hero.jpg
!images/about.jpg
!images/work-*.jpg
!images/before.jpg
!images/after.jpg

